An autolink or a cross-reference is atomic to brackets and braces

```
<https://a[> *q](u*) z
.
<p><a href="https://a[">https://a[</a> <strong>q](u</strong>) z</p>
```

```
</#a[> *q](u*) z
.
<p>&lt;/#a[&gt; <strong>q](u</strong>) z</p>
```

```
{*a </#x*}> b*}
.
<p><strong>a &lt;/#x*}&gt; b</strong></p>
```
